      "raw": "<p>Hi Everyone! For the last month Ive been working on and planning a Sentinels Cinematic Universe!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo explain- I plan to have several GMs, and upwards of 8 players, playing in several parallel campaigns set in the different areas of the Sentinels universe-</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Megalopolis, Rook City, The Cosmos, Adventures around Earth, and so on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Campaigns would connect with eachother while maintaining distinct identies as separate hero teams- think of Marvels Infinity War-</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You had the Thor Team tryign to make the ultimate weapon, the Iron Man team tryign to stop Thanos, and the Captain America team trying to defend Vision.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Big events would be handled this way, and smaller events would happen to individual teams</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Characters could crossover and connect through separate OneShot sessions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At the moment I have 2 GMs and 7 Players ready and we are goign to start scheduling and creating characters this coming week.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I would like more players and at least 1 more GM however, and thats why Ive contacted you all here!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If youre interested, please drop by our Discord, you can leave again at any time!<br />\r\nSpectators to the Cinematic Universe are also welcome ^^</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/naEfFpS\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/naEfFpS</a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>",
